{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Resort Manager</u></strong> \u2013 become the owner of a holiday resort and build the tourist empire of your dreams! Manage, invest, and grow your summer haven to attract more and more guests and transform a small getaway into a vibrant hotspot full of attractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeb4\ud83c\udf66\ud83c\udfd0 <strong>Grow your resort</strong>: Buy new facilities and services \u2013 from pedal boat rentals and snack machines to volleyball courts. Set prices and watch your resort start generating income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/4e61847f8e8cf4c0fed9527eca7beeb3.poster.avif?t=1758807947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/4e61847f8e8cf4c0fed9527eca7beeb3.webm?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/4e61847f8e8cf4c0fed9527eca7beeb3.mp4?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd14\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong><u>Understand tourists\u2019 needs:</u></strong> Observe what your visitors are looking for \u2013 do they want more attractions? More food options? Or maybe they\u2019re after peace and quiet? Listen carefully and respond to their changing needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/0fd05ce9b887b691d485784fbaf8e8c0.poster.avif?t=1758807947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/0fd05ce9b887b691d485784fbaf8e8c0.webm?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/0fd05ce9b887b691d485784fbaf8e8c0.mp4?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udd27\ud83d\udc65 <strong><u>Serve your guests:</u></strong> Every new attraction comes with added responsibilities. You're in charge of direct customer service \u2013 from handling payments to delivering services. Your dedication and organizational skills have a direct impact on guest satisfaction and the pace of your resort\u2019s development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/3cd0d758ccbda2d525fec65757554adb.poster.avif?t=1758807947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/3cd0d758ccbda2d525fec65757554adb.webm?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/3cd0d758ccbda2d525fec65757554adb.mp4?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf73\ud83e\uddf9\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong><u>Hire staff:</u></strong> As your resort expands, it\u2019ll be time to delegate tasks. Invest in loyal employees who can take over duties \u2013 from chefs and vendors to attraction attendants. Thanks to them, you can focus on bigger investments and overall management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/9233c15c0a950d590460ec3968c54cd1.poster.avif?t=1758807947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/9233c15c0a950d590460ec3968c54cd1.webm?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/9233c15c0a950d590460ec3968c54cd1.mp4?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf\ud83d\udd13\ud83c\udf04 <strong><u>Unlock new opportunities:</u></strong> Develop your resort to gain access to new areas, attractions, and upgrades that will take your resort to a whole new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/7af806109421bf96699278e7d0eb0d52.poster.avif?t=1758807947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/7af806109421bf96699278e7d0eb0d52.webm?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/extras/7af806109421bf96699278e7d0eb0d52.mp4?t=1758807947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917750?t=1758807947","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917750?t=1758807947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/6fafa91068e895aa690479b6357d831d7a6ae930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758807947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917750/6fafa91068e895aa690479b6357d831d7a6ae930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17